# Case directories (cryo_3d, cryo_no_eb_3d) hold exactly three kinds of tracked
# file -- GNUmakefile, inputs.*, *.sh -- and everything else in them is build or
# run output: *.ex, tmp_build_dir/, plt*/, chk*/, Backtrace.*, *.dat, and one
# directory per run.
#
# Allowlist rather than blocklist. A blocklist needs a new rule every time a run
# script invents a new output name (gpu_smoke_0915_221544/, tc1/, L3_0916_0830/);
# this catches them the day they appear, with nothing to remember. Adding a new
# kind of *tracked* file to a case dir needs a new "!" line below -- or a one-off
# `git add -f <path>`.
cryo*/*
!cryo*/GNUmakefile
!cryo*/inputs.*
!cryo*/*.sh
